  "summary": "no allow list for Spring Cloud Commons writable /actuator/env",
  "details": "There is no allow list for property keys when Spring Cloud Commons writable /actuator/env is enabled.\n\nMitigation:\n\nBump to a fixed version and set `management.endpoint.env.post.valid-keys-regex` to a valid regular expression that only matches property keys that are allowed to be dynamically updated.",
